  <http://example.org/example> "Additional information: This feature is on the upper continental slope, 45 km offshore from the E coast of the North Island of New Zealand. The name first appeared on Oceanic Bathymetry Series (OBS) chart 'Cook' in 1991.Minimum depth (m): 475. Maximum depth (m): 1300. Total relief (m): 825."@en ;
  <http://example.org/example> "Coordinates in ACUF: Latitude: -76.050017; Longitude: 166.299951"@en ;
