  <http://example.org/example> """GEBCO: discoverer and year of discovery: Discoverer: British vessel HMS "Barracouta". Year of discovery: 1811. History: Named after Lt. W. Owen aboard HMS "Barracouta", who reported this feature in 1811."""@en ;
