  <http://example.org/example> "Additional information: Feature description: A northwest-southeast trending continuous precipitous scarp, approximately 330km northeast of East Cape on the eastern margin of Hikurangi Plateau. History/Origin/Meaning: Named after the RV Rapuhia, a New Zealand research vessel (DSIR), 1986-1992."@en ;
