  <http://example.org/example> """GEBCO: discoverer and year of discovery: Discoverer: Korean research vessel "Haeyang 2000". Year of discovery: 1997. History: Usan was the name of the nearby Ulleung Do (Ulleung Island, Republic of Korea), before the 5th century."""@en ;
  <http://example.org/example> """GEBCO: discoverer and year of discovery: Discoverer: U.S. oceanographic survey vessel "Surveyor". Year of discovery: 1988. History: Named after Rear Admiral Paul A. Smith (?-1978) of the United States Coast and Geodetic Survey (C&GS), a pioneer bathymetrist, being the first to contour the slopes"""@en ;
